Subject: sdk_hard-dereference-tar-gz — add --hard-dereference after ownership arguments

Alpine aports refreshes this patch when dotnet `TarGzFileCreateFromDirectory.cs` gains
`NormalizeSourceBuildOwnership` arguments. The stable-branch hunk targets the old one-line
`GetDestinationArchive()` helper; dotnet v10.0.114 needs `--hard-dereference` appended after
the ownership prefix instead.

Origin: vendor, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alpinelinux/aports/f32879e33fb3c7305cc1b7acf83c735eb512275a/community/dotnet10-runtime/sdk_hard-dereference-tar-gz.patch
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet.git 0427b9abbead3fa64c6655eb4290c537397131fa
Adaptation: Replace the stable-branch one-line GetDestinationArchive hunk with a hunk that inserts --hard-dereference after the NormalizeSourceBuildOwnership prefix for dotnet v10.0.114.
Drop-When: dependency aports/community/dotnet10-runtime >= 10.0.14

diff --git a/src/sdk/src/Tasks/sdk-tasks/TarGzFileCreateFromDirectory.cs.orig b/src/sdk/src/Tasks/sdk-tasks/TarGzFileCreateFromDirectory.cs
--- a/src/sdk/src/Tasks/sdk-tasks/TarGzFileCreateFromDirectory.cs.orig
+++ b/src/sdk/src/Tasks/sdk-tasks/TarGzFileCreateFromDirectory.cs
@@ -119,7 +119,7 @@ private string GetDestinationArchive()
                 ? "--numeric-owner --owner=2001 --group=2001 "
                 : string.Empty;
 
-            return $"{ownershipArguments}-czf {DestinationArchive}";
+            return $"{ownershipArguments}--hard-dereference -czf {DestinationArchive}";
         }
 
         private string GetExcludes()
